---
title: "Contact — Oghenemaro Okolosio"
description: "Get in touch with Oghenemaro Okolosio by email, LinkedIn or GitHub, or book a call."
layout: layouts/main.njk
---

<section class="section intro">
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p class="role">{{ cv.location }} · {{ cv.availability }}</p>
  <p>
    Whether it's a role, a system that needs untangling, or a product you want
    to get off the ground, I'm glad to hear about it. Email is best.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2 class="label">Reach me</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {% for item in cv.contact %}
      <li class="row">
        <span class="aside">{{ item.label }}</span>
        <a href="{{ item.url }}"{% if not item.url.startsWith("mailto:") %} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}>{{ item.text }}</a>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
